<title>RUSSIA: Mosenergo 1995 eps $0.16 under US GAAP.</title>
<headline>Mosenergo 1995 eps $0.16 under US GAAP.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended Dec 31</p>
<p>					1995	    1994</p>
<p>    Sales ($ mln)		2,929	   1,931</p>
<p>    Operating profit	     653	     385</p>
<p>    Net profit		     383	     129</p>
<p>    Earnings per share ($)    0.16	    0.05</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures restated to U.S. GAAP, audited by Arthur Andersen. Full name OAO Energetiki i Elektrifikatsii Mosenergo 0#MSNG.RUO. UES owns 49 percent of Mosenergo, corporate investors 33 percent, households 18 percent.</p>
<p>Mosenergo ADRs are traded in Berlin, Frankfurt and on the OTC market.</p>
<p>In April Mosenergo issued the following data to Russian accounting standards.</p>
<p>    Sales (rbls)		9.8 trln	  3.5 trln</p>
<p>    Net profit		  2.4 trln	  841.4 bln</p>
<p>    Earnings per share	   956		 329</p>
<p>NOTE - Dollar on Moscow Interbank Currency Exchange (MICEX):</p>
<p>    Dec 29, 1995	 4,640</p>
<p>    Dec 29, 1994	 3,550</p>
<p>--Olga Popova, Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
